--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+Rename the ``prerelease_token`` keyword of :meth:`semver.version.Version.next_version` to ``token``, matching :meth:`~semver.version.Version.bump_prerelease` and :meth:`~semver.version.Version.bump_build`.
+Passing ``prerelease_token=`` still works but emits a :class:`DeprecationWarning`.
